---
// 后台入口做成 Astro 路由而不是 public 下的静态文件：
// dev 服务器不会把 public/admin/ 解析成目录索引，放 public 时开发环境访问 /admin/ 会 404。
// 配置仍在 public/admin/config.yml，Sveltia CMS 会从当前目录去取。
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#268358" />
    <link rel="icon" href="../../favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <title>砚台与代码 · 内容工作台</title>
  </head>
  <body data-pagefind-ignore>
    <header class="admin-brand" data-admin-shell>
      <a href="../../" class="admin-brand-link" aria-label="返回博客首页">
        <img src="../../favicon.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32" />
        <span>
          <strong>砚台与代码</strong>
          <small>内容工作台</small>
        </span>
      </a>
      <a href="../../" class="admin-site-link">查看博客</a>
    </header>

    <main class="admin-loading" data-admin-shell role="status" aria-live="polite">
      <span class="admin-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div>
        <strong>正在打开内容工作台</strong>
        <p>加载文章、动态、友链与页面管理功能…</p>
      </div>
    </main>

    <noscript>
      <main class="admin-fallback">
        <h1>需要启用 JavaScript</h1>
        <p>内容管理后台依赖 JavaScript 才能加载，请启用后刷新页面。</p>
        <a href="../../">返回博客首页</a>
      </main>
    </noscript>

    <style is:inline>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light dark;
        font-family:
          system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC',
          'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        background: #f8fafc;
        color: #35434f;
      }

      .admin-brand {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        min-height: 4rem;
        padding: 0.75rem clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
        border-bottom: 1px solid #dde3ea;
        background: rgb(255 255 255 / 92%);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      }

      .admin-brand-link {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .admin-brand-link span {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .admin-brand-link strong {
        color: #35434f;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      .admin-brand-link small {
        color: #6b7885;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
      }

      .admin-site-link {
        padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        background: #eafaf2;
        color: #1e7049;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .admin-loading {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        min-height: calc(100vh - 4rem);
        padding: 2rem;
      }

      .admin-loading strong {
        display: block;
        color: #35434f;
      }

      .admin-loading p {
        margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
        color: #6b7885;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
      }

      .admin-spinner {
        width: 1.25rem;
        height: 1.25rem;
        border: 2px solid #dde3ea;
        border-top-color: #268358;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        animation: admin-spin 0.75s linear infinite;
      }

      @keyframes admin-spin {
        to {
          transform: rotate(360deg);
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .admin-spinner {
          animation: none;
          border-color: #268358;
        }
      }

      .admin-fallback {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        width: min(100% - 2rem, 32rem);
        margin: 15vh auto 0;
        padding: 2rem;
        border: 1px solid #dde3ea;
        border-radius: 1rem;
        background: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgb(0 0 0 / 8%);
      }

      .admin-fallback h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
      }

      .admin-fallback p {
        margin: 0.75rem 0 1.25rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #50616d;
      }

      .admin-fallback a {
        color: #268358;
        text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
      }

      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        body {
          background: #1a202c;
          color: #f3f7fb;
        }

        .admin-fallback {
          border-color: #3f4c5f;
          background: #232b38;
        }

        .admin-fallback p {
          color: #a0aec0;
        }

        .admin-fallback a {
          color: #68d391;
        }
      }
    </style>

    {/*
      Sveltia CMS 从 CDN 加载，不需要额外样式表，也不要加 type="module"
      （它不是 ES 模块，加了会影响其 JavaScript API）。
      必须用 is:inline，否则 Vite 会改写这个 script 的地址。
      用模板注释而非 HTML 注释，避免这段说明被输出到生产页面。
    */}
    <script
      is:inline
      src="https://unpkg.com/@sveltia/cms/dist/sveltia-cms.js"
      onload="document.querySelectorAll('[data-admin-shell]').forEach((element) => element.remove())"
      onerror="document.querySelector('[data-admin-shell][role=status] p').textContent='后台资源加载失败，请检查网络后刷新页面。'"
    ></script>
  </body>
</html>
